# Configure JWTSettings__SecretKey (at least 32 bytes) and
# JWTSettings__ExpirationInMinutes in the environment before starting the API.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5261
@token = substituir-pelo-token-retornado-no-login

### Cadastrar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "usuario-teste",
  "senha": "senha-local-segura"
}

### Entrar e obter JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "usuario-teste",
  "senha": "senha-local-segura"
}

### Consultar usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar faixas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks

### Buscar faixa por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/1

### Buscar faixas por filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/search?genero=Rock&bpmMediaMinima=100&valenciaMinima=2

### Listar generos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/genres

### Listar paises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/countries

### Listar playlists do usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obter playlist do usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar playlist a partir de IDs de faixas existentes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Minha playlist",
  "faixaIds": [1, 2]
}

### Exemplo de erro: faixa inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/999999
